    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "What was the main objective of early mountain climbers?",
      "translation": "早期登山者的主要目标是什么？",
      "startTime": 9.82,
      "endTime": 15.29,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Objective",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "目标"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Modern alpinists try to climb mountains by a route which will give them good sport,",
      "translation": "现代登山运动员尝试通过能给他们带来运动乐趣的路线登山，",
      "startTime": 15.3,
      "endTime": 21.92,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Alpinists",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "登山运动员"
          },
          {
            "word": "Route",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "路线"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "and the more difficult it is, the more highly it is regarded.",
      "translation": "而且路线越难，其评价就越高。",
      "startTime": 21.93,
      "endTime": 27.37,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Regarded",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "看待，评价"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "In the pioneering days however, this was not the case at all.",
      "translation": "然而，在开创时期，情况完全不是这样。",
      "startTime": 27.38,
      "endTime": 33.64,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Pioneering",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "开创性的，先驱的"
          },
          {
            "word": "Case",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "情况，事实"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "The early climbers were looking for the easiest way to the top because the summit was the prize they sought,",
      "translation": "早期的登山者寻找到达顶峰最容易的路径，因为顶峰才是他们追求的目标，",
      "startTime": 33.65,
      "endTime": 41.87,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Summit",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "顶峰"
          },
          {
            "word": "Prize",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "奖赏，寻求的目标"
          },
          {
            "word": "Sought",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "寻找（seek的过去式）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "especially if it had never been attained before.",
      "translation": "特别是如果这个顶峰以前从未有人登顶过。",
      "startTime": 41.88,
      "endTime": 46.24,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Especially",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "尤其地"
          },
