            "word": "Shudder",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "战栗，发抖"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "but they did not go out of their way to court such excitement.",
      "translation": "但他们并不会特意去追求那种刺激。",
      "startTime": 61.19,
      "endTime": 65.86,
