            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "唯一的，孤独的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "It is hard for us to realize nowadays how difficult it was for the pioneers.",
      "translation": "现在我们很难意识到当初那些先驱者的处境有多么艰难。",
      "startTime": 72.55,
      "endTime": 79.2,
