    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Except for one or two places such as Zermatt and Chamonix, which had rapidly become popular.",
      "translation": "除了像采尔马特和夏蒙尼这样的几个因迅速出名而变得受欢迎的地方外。",
