    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Alpine villages tended to be impoverished settlements cut off from civilization by the high mountains.",
      "translation": "阿尔卑斯山的村庄往往是贫困的定居点，由于高山阻隔而与文明世界隔绝。",
      "startTime": 87.74,
      "endTime": 96.39,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Impoverished",
            "pos": "adj.",
