            "pos": "phr.",
            "meaning": "切断，隔绝"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Such inns as there were were generally dirty and flea-ridden;",
      "translation": "那里的旅店通常既脏又到处是跳蚤；",
      "startTime": 96.4,
      "endTime": 101.97,
