    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Often a valley boasted no inn at all, and climbers found shelter wherever they could --",
      "translation": "山谷里通常根本没有旅店，登山者只能随处寻找避难所——",
      "startTime": 111.85,
